msgctxt "ActionTransient:27807:0:0"
msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 2,400 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Enshrouded</ui-edge-color></ui-color> effect expires upon execution.<br>Requires at least one stack of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Lemure Shroud</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to execute.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
