msgid "Quickly dash 15 yalms forward.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Allows next <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Harpe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to be cast immediately<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Leaves behind a <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Hellsgate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> at point of origin, and grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Threshold</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to self<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>10s<br>Cannot be executed while bound.<br>Shares a recast timer with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hell's Egress</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
