msgid "Restores target's HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>3,000<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Addersgall Cost: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>1<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Addersgall</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is granted automatically every 10 seconds."
